=== A. D9 谱织 a0 组件纯框架性检查 ===
d_gluon = dA*C2 = 8*2 = 16 —— 框架量（伴随维 8 = k_max，Casimir 2）
d_q 主项 = Nf*Nc*(CF/2)*sqrt(dlmin/dl3)/Z2 = 3.503735  (paper17 记 3.50)
  Z2 = 1.44 = 36/25？ True —— 框架身份？
  1.44 = 1.2^2 = (6/5)^2 = (Nc+3)/5？ (Nc+3)/5 = 1.2
  1.44 vs (kmax/2+1)/?  —— 待查
delta_d(s) ≈ CF/2*e^-1*Nc = 0.735759 (paper17 记 1.08——e^-ms/Tc 用 e^-1? 实际 ms/Tc≈1)
d_q = 4.239494 (paper17 记 4.58≈14/3=4.667)

=== B. a0 与 (b0/10)^3 的代数差 ===
a0^3     = 0.387636192
(b0/10)^3 = 0.729000000
ratio a0^3/base = 0.531736888
dev = -18.98497%  (a0 vs base 一次方)

  62/(36π√2) = 0.387636192
  729/1000    = 0.729000000
  差 = -46.82631%
  62*1000/(729*36*π*√2) = 0.531736888 —— 无简单有理
  62 = 2*(31)? 31 非框架量；62 = 16+46? 46 非框架；62 = 3*d_eff? d_eff=62/3

